---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { sitePath } from "@/lib/paths";
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About the Slop Factor research dataset.">
  <article class="shell prose-page prose-page--short">
    <header class="prose-header">
      <p class="eyebrow">Project scope</p>
      <h1>About Slop Factor</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        This project studies structural characteristics of AI-assisted
        mathematics papers using only explicit author disclosures.
      </p>
    </header>

    <section>
      <h2>Purpose</h2>
      <p>
        The dataset supports transparent, reproducible study of how disclosed AI
        assistance appears alongside document features such as length,
        theorem-like statements, equations, bibliographies, and appendices. It
        is descriptive rather than evaluative.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Review standard</h2>
      <p>
        Automated discovery narrows the review queue by locating disclosure
        terms. A person must then confirm that the authors describe their own
        use, preserve the exact quotation and location, choose the applicable
        disclosure classification, and approve the structural analysis.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2>Interpretation</h2>
      <p>
        Inclusion says nothing about the paper’s correctness, originality,
        significance, or authorial integrity. The Slop Factor is a transparent,
        unbounded formula applied to document structure; it is not an AI
        detector.
      </p>
      <a class="button" href={sitePath("methodology/")}
        >Review the methodology</a
      >
    </section>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
